1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,510
Hello, we are Team Emerge.

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:03,830
Fire is growing both in Europe and the USA.

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,690
We spoke with a fire department professional

4
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,610
who told us that one of their top problems

5
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,450
is predict fire one day in advance.

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,110
This would allow them to position the necessary resources

7
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,910
to extinguish the fire more efficiently

8
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:14,970
and manage its spread.

9
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,170
So we integrated 22 data sources

10
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,610
in one web app, including VIIRS and MODIS,

11
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:21,490
and created a machine learning algorithm

12
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,910
that's better than the NASA Fire Weather Index.

13
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,230
And everything allows for better prevention

14
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,400
and preparedness.
